            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> Can this patch go to vim first?\r\n\r\nI'll check and report back later. I have to see whether Vim exhibits the same slowdown and if/how this approach could be adapted there.\r\n\r\n> Why'd you choose 8ms as the interval?\r\n\r\nThe chosen interval is a tradeoff between batching expensive refreshes and keeping intermediate updates frequent, so there is no universally optimal value.\r\nI tested 16ms as well and results were comparable, but happy to adjust if needed and/or run additional tests.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
